      "name": "BIAB — Wholesale, not MLM",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "Wholesale, Not MLM",
        "heading": "You Sell Products. That's It.",
        "subheading": "There is no recruitment structure here, and nothing to sign up beneath you. Your income comes from retailing genuine products to real customers.",
        "yes_title": "What this is",
        "yes_list": "You buy stock at wholesale and retail it at your own prices.\nYour margin comes from the difference, on every unit you sell.\nYou reorder the lines that sell, at reseller pricing.\nYou keep your own customers and your own business.",
